WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:39.039
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:39.309 --> 01:41.642
[Episode 8]

3
02:05.920 --> 02:07.186
Do you like it?

4
02:08.813 --> 02:12.153
Lilacs are hard to grow in Nanhuai's climate.

5
02:12.153 --> 02:15.213
This one actually has buds.

6
02:17.400 --> 02:21.699
If you want it, I'll make it happen. Whatever it takes.

7
02:24.600 --> 02:26.253
That's very thoughtful of you.

8
02:26.253 --> 02:29.633
But you're so busy with military affairs, you don't need to spend time on this.

9
02:31.360 --> 02:34.786
Flowers bloom, and then they wither.

10
02:35.680 --> 02:39.480
What's the point of obsessing over whether they bloom?

11
03:00.680 --> 03:03.625
Sitting here all by yourself must be terribly dull.

12
03:03.625 --> 03:06.955
Would you like to join Mrs. Gu for a few rounds?

13
03:06.955 --> 03:09.133
Are you doing Chang Xuan a favor, Mother?

14
03:09.133 --> 03:11.160
Or is it safest if you handle it yourself?

15
03:11.160 --> 03:13.064
Look at you!

16
03:13.064 --> 03:17.400
You see everything so clearly, except when it comes to yourself.

17
03:21.640 --> 03:23.920
How are things with Bing Wen lately?

18
03:25.440 --> 03:26.700
Pretty good.

19
03:27.319 --> 03:30.666
Every time I ask, you say "pretty good".

20
03:39.720 --> 03:41.533
You still haven't forgotten him.

21
03:43.920 --> 03:46.320
I know there's a knot in your heart.

22
03:47.159 --> 03:49.566
You resent your father for separating you.

23
03:52.240 --> 03:55.060
I stopped thinking about the past long ago.

24
03:55.960 --> 03:59.920
Besides, when someone dies, that's the end.

25
03:59.920 --> 04:02.360
He's gone.

26
04:02.360 --> 04:05.880
Thinking about him won't change anything.

27
04:08.200 --> 04:13.906
For families like ours, marriage isn't ours to decide.

28
04:13.906 --> 04:17.706
We cannot dwell on love and romance.

29
04:18.920 --> 04:21.360
When I married your father,

30
04:21.360 --> 04:23.560
it was a decent match, nothing more.

31
04:24.240 --> 04:28.279
But all these years, we went through thick and thin.

32
04:28.279 --> 04:29.880
We had you and your siblings.

33
04:29.880 --> 04:32.110
We built this family together.

34
04:32.110 --> 04:36.440
In the end, we couldn't live without each other.

35
04:40.560 --> 04:41.926
Trust me.

36
04:41.926 --> 04:43.199
I can see it.

37
04:43.199 --> 04:46.246
Bing Wen truly cares about you.

38
04:55.320 --> 04:59.197
You can't stay trapped in your past forever.

39
04:59.197 --> 05:01.960
In life, we have to look ahead.

40
05:01.960 --> 05:04.300
All right, sweetheart? Go play cards.

41
05:04.300 --> 05:06.439
- Mother. - Go on.

42
05:18.393 --> 05:19.680
It smells amazing.

43
05:19.680 --> 05:21.760
They're all your favorites.

44
05:21.760 --> 05:24.443
And your favorite osmanthus cake.

45
05:24.443 --> 05:26.179
- Try some. - Okay.

46
05:31.720 --> 05:32.780
How is it?

47
05:34.040 --> 05:35.953
That's exactly how I remember it.

48
05:35.953 --> 05:39.920
All those years abroad, I missed your cooking most of all.

49
05:40.520 --> 05:41.943
Slow down.

50
05:41.943 --> 05:44.584
Stop laying it on so thick and flattering my mother.

51
05:46.160 --> 05:49.779
Xue Ting. All these years, you were studying abroad alone.

52
05:49.779 --> 05:51.480
Yet you kept sending me medicine.

53
05:51.480 --> 05:53.280
You must have gone without so much.

54
05:53.280 --> 05:56.339
I feel terrible about it.

55
05:57.600 --> 05:59.960
You and my mother were sworn sisters.

56
06:00.680 --> 06:05.259
I was only six or seven when she passed away, and you raised me.

57
06:05.259 --> 06:10.133
I care for you just as I would my own mother.

58
06:13.840 --> 06:15.121
Have some fish.

59
06:17.160 --> 06:18.360
By the way, Xue Ting.

60
06:18.360 --> 06:23.100
Why didn't you mention it in your letter that you were coming back early?

61
06:27.320 --> 06:30.600
I wanted to give you and Ping Jun a surprise.

62
06:30.600 --> 06:32.773
And with the world in such turmoil, I wanted to come back sooner.

63
06:32.773 --> 06:36.206
This way, I have time to look for opportunities and settle on a job.

64
06:37.560 --> 06:40.899
When Xue Ting was twelve, his essays were already brilliant.

65
06:40.899 --> 06:43.319
Otherwise, how could he have studied abroad on a grant?

66
06:43.319 --> 06:47.279
You will definitely find a job where you can put your talents to use.

67
06:47.279 --> 06:48.279
You will.

68
06:53.080 --> 06:55.421
So where are you planning to stay?

69
06:56.375 --> 06:57.677
I rented a small courtyard house.

70
06:57.677 --> 06:59.530
It's just one alley over.

71
06:59.530 --> 07:02.079
That way, I can take good care of you.

72
08:44.159 --> 08:45.659
Ping Jun.

73
08:45.659 --> 08:47.220
Do you still remember?

74
08:47.220 --> 08:50.220
When we were little, whenever the weather was nice,

75
08:50.220 --> 08:54.919
I'd carry a bamboo pole and take you to catch cicadas and crickets.

76
08:55.640 --> 08:58.240
We also plugged antholes with mud.

77
08:58.240 --> 08:59.720
Of course I do.

78
08:59.720 --> 09:02.517
When we were little, we went to the same school.

79
09:02.517 --> 09:07.366
I was late for school while playing, so you helped me climb over the back wall.

80
09:08.680 --> 09:11.640
There was a pomegranate tree beside it.

81
09:12.559 --> 09:15.680
You were always pestering me to pick pomegranates for you.

82
09:15.680 --> 09:18.960
Once, I accidentally fell off the wall.

83
09:18.960 --> 09:20.697
I got a huge bump on the back of my head.

84
09:20.697 --> 09:22.800
It never went away.

85
09:22.800 --> 09:24.493
What about now?

86
09:24.493 --> 09:26.072
Has it gone down?

87
09:29.000 --> 09:30.240
Feel it.

88
09:30.240 --> 09:31.660
See if it's gone down.

89
09:43.000 --> 09:44.533
Ping Jun.

90
09:44.533 --> 09:49.926
Actually, during my four years in Japan, I often felt like a stranger.

91
09:50.687 --> 09:52.326
There was also a language barrier.

92
09:53.252 --> 09:57.352
Even the food tasted lonely.

93
09:58.760 --> 10:03.140
Whenever that happened, I thought of you.

94
10:06.600 --> 10:10.919
Sometimes, I missed you so much I thought I'd go crazy.

95
10:14.240 --> 10:17.207
Why are you saying this all of a sudden?

96
10:18.040 --> 10:19.346
It's not sudden.

97
10:20.440 --> 10:22.513
I've wanted to say this for a long time.

98
10:27.240 --> 10:30.760
Weren't we promised to each other as children?

99
10:31.440 --> 10:35.920
We were too young then, so I want to ask you one more time.

100
10:37.440 --> 10:43.280
Will you marry me after graduation?

101
11:01.240 --> 11:02.280
No.

102
11:04.280 --> 11:05.697
That's because you lied to me.

103
11:05.697 --> 11:07.919
You said you wouldn't be back for another month.

104
11:10.280 --> 11:11.397
I promise you.

105
11:11.397 --> 11:14.519
From now on, I won't hide anything from you again.

106
11:15.520 --> 11:17.000
We'll see how you do.

107
11:19.520 --> 11:21.160
Charge!

108
11:22.700 --> 11:24.059
Wait for me.

109
11:24.059 --> 11:25.980
Charge!

110
11:33.740 --> 11:34.740
Let's go.

111
12:10.400 --> 12:11.680
Are you okay?

112
12:13.620 --> 12:14.846
I'm fine.

113
13:27.920 --> 13:30.172
What are you staring at?

114
13:30.172 --> 13:31.880
Spring Wind Troupe.

115
13:31.880 --> 13:33.520
[Supporting the Refugees] That's impressive.

116
13:33.520 --> 13:37.644
All on their own, they changed the refugees' fate.

117
13:37.644 --> 13:41.052
Especially the female student who wrote the play.

118
13:41.052 --> 13:43.800
This review attacks the government.

119
13:43.800 --> 13:45.720
That's practically treasonous.

120
13:47.160 --> 13:51.980
A girl putting herself out in public, stirring up trouble.

121
13:53.000 --> 13:55.896
Let's see who would dare marry her now.

122
13:55.896 --> 13:57.860
You're putting it that harshly.

123
13:57.860 --> 14:00.966
What poor girl is marrying into our family?

124
14:01.720 --> 14:03.577
What time is it? Only coming down now?

125
14:03.577 --> 14:05.338
What were you doing last night?

126
14:08.000 --> 14:11.537
She was up last night doing homework until very late.

127
14:11.537 --> 14:13.520
What's wrong with letting her sleep in?

128
14:13.520 --> 14:16.360
Exactly. I worked so hard.

129
14:17.920 --> 14:20.820
Then after breakfast, I'll quiz you.

130
14:20.820 --> 14:24.940
Let me see how the new tutor has been teaching you.

131
14:29.960 --> 14:31.650
By the way, where's Third Mother?

132
14:31.650 --> 14:33.600
Why don't I see her come down for breakfast?

133
14:33.600 --> 14:35.400
She left first thing this morning.

134
14:35.400 --> 14:38.560
She said she was going to Detianxiang to buy the finest gastrodia root.

135
14:38.560 --> 14:42.630
She wants to stew it herself for hours to help your father build up his strength.

136
14:42.630 --> 14:44.709
She really is thoughtful.

137
14:45.600 --> 14:50.520
Were you talking about the female playwright from the Spring Wind Troupe?

138
14:50.520 --> 14:52.497
She's very famous now.

139
14:52.497 --> 14:57.280
They say she and the troupe helped refugees settle into their new lives.

140
14:57.280 --> 15:00.770
And that's not all. She's also helping them find work so they can support themselves.

141
15:00.770 --> 15:03.709
This girl is remarkable.

142
15:05.800 --> 15:10.360
Chang Xuan punished Feng San Li over a piece of land.

143
15:10.360 --> 15:15.220
Isn't that the Qingshui Town the papers said was taking in refugees?

144
15:17.480 --> 15:21.120
Whatever you do, you must leave yourself some room.

145
15:21.120 --> 15:23.916
You need reason, advantage, and restraint.

146
15:23.916 --> 15:29.137
With Chang Xuan acting like this, who knows how many older allies he's offended?

147
15:29.137 --> 15:30.704
What about you?

148
15:30.704 --> 15:35.600
When you first took office, you showed those old fossils no mercy at all.

149
15:35.600 --> 15:38.010
You swept them out ruthlessly.

150
15:38.010 --> 15:40.399
My son still has years to learn from that.

151
15:42.040 --> 15:43.228
What are you laughing at?

152
15:43.880 --> 15:45.240
Just eat.

153
15:56.040 --> 15:58.453
Stop at Li's Preserves up ahead.

154
15:58.453 --> 16:01.120
Miss Qi Xuan likes them. I'll buy some.

155
16:36.480 --> 16:39.499
I was worried you'd gotten hooked on being the Yu family's son-in-law,

156
16:40.440 --> 16:42.200
and forgetting what day it is.

157
16:50.720 --> 16:54.799
[Father and Mother's Memorial Tablets] Yu Chang Xuan is rather capable.

158
16:55.880 --> 16:58.826
He quietly managed to secure the 9th Corps.

159
16:58.826 --> 17:04.425
At this rate, I fear his power base will only grow stronger.

160
17:05.680 --> 17:06.960
Don't worry.

161
17:08.000 --> 17:10.759
I won't let him keep acting so arrogantly.

162
17:14.040 --> 17:15.179
Brother.

163
17:16.940 --> 17:19.133
If you and our parents hadn't taken me in,

164
17:19.839 --> 17:22.119
I might have starved to death on the street.

165
17:22.840 --> 17:27.320
This is a debt I willingly repay.

166
17:27.320 --> 17:31.719
As long as I can avenge our parents with you, I'll do anything you ask.

167
17:33.120 --> 17:35.320
I'm just afraid it will all be for nothing.

168
17:35.320 --> 17:39.773
We've struggled so long to get here, not to watch the Yus flourish.

169
17:39.773 --> 17:41.073
Wan Qiao.

170
17:42.200 --> 17:44.120
Hang in there a little longer.

171
17:44.120 --> 17:48.400
Our revenge isn't just about killing Yu Zhong Quan.

172
17:50.240 --> 17:51.799
One day,

173
17:52.760 --> 17:59.087
I'll make the entire Yu family crawl at our feet.

174
18:36.280 --> 18:37.972
Why are you here?

175
18:37.972 --> 18:39.593
What do you want?

176
18:41.000 --> 18:42.916
We just wanted to talk.

177
18:42.916 --> 18:44.259
Don't move.

178
18:44.259 --> 18:45.460
Don't move.

179
18:47.720 --> 18:49.081
Ye Ping Jun.

180
18:49.680 --> 18:51.853
You scratched my face.

181
18:51.853 --> 18:56.523
Did you think hooking up with Gu Rui Tong would make me let this slide?

182
18:56.523 --> 19:00.520
You know perfectly well your injury had nothing to do with me.

183
19:00.520 --> 19:04.120
A sharp tongue won't help you.

184
19:04.120 --> 19:07.479
So today, I'm going to teach you a lesson.

185
19:22.299 --> 19:23.760
Don't do anything stupid.

186
19:23.760 --> 19:25.520
Nanhuai City has laws.

187
19:26.480 --> 19:27.841
Laws?

188
19:28.800 --> 19:33.180
They are meant to keep people like you in check and protect people like me.

189
19:33.755 --> 19:35.040
Got it?

190
19:35.040 --> 19:37.977
Do you really think what you do comes without consequences?

191
19:37.977 --> 19:42.100
I'm curious myself what the consequences will be.

192
19:55.000 --> 19:56.140
Stop!

193
20:00.680 --> 20:01.806
Xue Ting.

194
20:02.400 --> 20:03.860
What are you doing?

195
20:06.080 --> 20:07.800
Ye Ping Jun.

196
20:07.800 --> 20:10.916
How many men have you hooked up with?

197
20:10.916 --> 20:13.316
They keep coming to save you one after another!

198
20:13.316 --> 20:16.000
What's your name? Why are you bullying your classmate?

199
20:16.000 --> 20:17.840
Do you know who she is?

200
20:17.840 --> 20:20.806
She's the daughter of President Tao of Tonghui Bank.

201
20:24.440 --> 20:26.537
A president's daughter should be a noble lady.

202
20:26.537 --> 20:28.724
But you throw your weight around. That's not noble at all!

203
20:28.724 --> 20:29.840
You rascal!

204
20:29.840 --> 20:32.360
Your language is vulgar and your behavior is vile.

205
20:32.360 --> 20:34.543
I don't care whose daughter you are.

206
20:34.543 --> 20:38.563
I only saw how utterly rude she was.

207
20:48.520 --> 20:49.853
We're here.

208
20:50.960 --> 20:52.260
Get out.

209
20:54.400 --> 20:55.580
Come on.

210
20:57.826 --> 20:58.960
Come on.

211
20:58.960 --> 21:00.164
Mu.

212
21:00.164 --> 21:01.164
Careful.

213
21:04.640 --> 21:06.440
We can't thank you enough today.

214
21:06.440 --> 21:10.297
You picked Mu and An up from the hospital and even drove us home.

215
21:10.297 --> 21:12.317
These pastries are for the children.

216
21:13.120 --> 21:15.370
- Thank you, Master Chang Xuan. - Thank you, Brother Chang Xuan.

217
21:15.370 --> 21:17.019
You're welcome.

218
21:17.019 --> 21:18.800
Master Chang Xuan, you're here.

219
21:18.800 --> 21:21.310
Auntie Wang, Mu and An, you're back.

220
21:21.310 --> 21:23.279
Staffer Zhao, do we have enough men today?

221
21:23.279 --> 21:26.000
The children need showers, disinfection, and clean clothes.

222
21:26.000 --> 21:28.960
We've got more than enough. The Charity Union sent plenty of volunteers.

223
21:28.960 --> 21:32.200
And the entire Spring Wind Troupe came too.

224
21:32.200 --> 21:34.766
Master Chang Xuan, I'll take the children inside.

225
21:34.766 --> 21:37.760
Brother Chang Xuan, can you play with us?

226
21:37.760 --> 21:40.080
Mu, sweetheart, Master Chang Xuan is busy.

227
21:40.080 --> 21:42.199
- We've already imposed enough on him. - It's fine.

228
21:42.819 --> 21:44.279
I'm free today.

229
21:47.500 --> 21:48.960
Person.

230
21:48.960 --> 21:51.320
- Mouth. - Mouth.

231
21:51.320 --> 21:53.840
- Hand. - Hand.

232
21:53.840 --> 21:54.920
That's right. Very good.

233
21:54.920 --> 21:57.886
Are there any children who'd like to read it themselves?

234
22:02.480 --> 22:04.833
Master Chang Xuan, come this way.

235
22:07.240 --> 22:11.720
The union representatives were deeply moved by the Spring Wind Troupe's performance.

236
22:11.720 --> 22:14.120
When they returned, they arranged to secure this place.

237
22:14.120 --> 22:16.960
It will function as a temporary shelter for the refugees.

238
22:16.960 --> 22:19.360
Everyone's changed quite a bit.

239
22:19.360 --> 22:22.904
The Spring Wind Troupe sent teachers over to teach everyone to read and write.

240
22:22.904 --> 22:25.440
They also found these women jobs.

241
22:25.440 --> 22:27.432
Thanks to Director Liang and Miss Ye.

242
22:27.432 --> 22:31.793
They applied to the Charity Union for land, and sent seeds and fertilizer.

243
22:31.793 --> 22:34.864
Miss Ye said this aid won't last forever.

244
22:34.864 --> 22:37.840
[Love others' children as you love your own] They need to learn to support themselves.

245
22:37.840 --> 22:41.019
This way. The backyard is where the children live.

246
22:41.019 --> 22:42.039
Come on.

247
22:44.480 --> 22:45.841
Sit still.

248
23:18.560 --> 23:20.219
Sister Ping Jun.

249
23:40.320 --> 23:41.764
Master Chang Xuan.

250
23:41.764 --> 23:43.780
What brings you here today?

251
23:47.400 --> 23:48.759
Do I have to report to you?

252
23:50.040 --> 23:52.420
Why are you suddenly angry?

253
23:55.520 --> 24:01.040
You think gestures like teaching a few words will solve their problems?

254
24:02.680 --> 24:03.919
What else?

255
24:04.480 --> 24:07.939
Would you rather have them beg?

256
24:07.939 --> 24:13.283
Do you think they are only fit to live on charity like ants?

257
24:13.283 --> 24:15.730
They've never lived on handouts.

258
24:15.730 --> 24:18.851
They can also rely on their limited means to support themselves.

259
24:20.920 --> 24:22.479
Support themselves?

260
24:23.920 --> 24:27.893
Every brick and tile here was paid for by Nanhuai.

261
24:32.120 --> 24:36.860
I can let them stay, and I can send them away anytime.

262
24:40.840 --> 24:42.232
That's right.

263
24:42.232 --> 24:46.760
Master Chang Xuan, you can easily drive them all out.

264
24:46.760 --> 24:50.960
Since you look down on what we do, please don't lower yourself by coming here.

265
24:50.960 --> 24:53.026
We don't want to soil your precious feet.

266
24:57.120 --> 24:59.120
You've gotten bold, Ye Ping Jun.

267
24:59.760 --> 25:01.599
How dare you talk to me like that?

268
25:02.573 --> 25:04.680
Am I wrong?

269
25:04.680 --> 25:06.997
They don't want to become a burden on Nanhuai either.

270
25:06.997 --> 25:11.138
They're refugees now, but that doesn't mean they'll always be.

271
25:12.480 --> 25:15.293
Wildflowers and weeds have lives of their own.

272
25:15.293 --> 25:17.512
Even on the most barren land,

273
25:17.512 --> 25:20.020
if it offers them a glimmer of hope,

274
25:20.020 --> 25:23.546
they'll work to put down roots and grow toward the sky.

275
25:42.080 --> 25:43.759
Why aren't you saying anything?

276
25:55.880 --> 26:00.286
These people will remain undocumented, no matter what.

277
26:00.286 --> 26:02.870
For them to put down roots is easier said than done.

278
26:02.870 --> 26:07.649
I hope you don't work yourselves to the bone only to end up with nothing.

279
26:10.480 --> 26:13.320
Then I won't trouble you with this.

280
26:13.320 --> 26:14.950
You're busy with official duties.

281
26:14.950 --> 26:16.291
Please go back.

282
26:41.240 --> 26:42.386
Come in.

283
26:43.840 --> 26:45.080
Master Chang Xuan.

284
26:45.840 --> 26:47.080
Take a look.

285
26:47.080 --> 26:49.700
This candidate ranked first on the written test during this recruitment.

286
26:49.700 --> 26:51.765
He beat the second-place candidate by a full 50 points.

287
26:53.240 --> 26:56.960
But I strongly advise against hiring him.

288
26:56.960 --> 26:58.215
Why?

289
26:58.215 --> 27:00.960
He's just too arrogant.

290
27:00.960 --> 27:04.566
He came right out and said the Mauser C96 we procured was outdated.

291
27:04.566 --> 27:06.673
Yes, he has a point.

292
27:06.673 --> 27:08.680
But he can't come in and start lecturing his superiors.

293
27:08.680 --> 27:10.197
He has no respect for authority.

294
27:10.197 --> 27:11.720
Does anyone really act like that?

295
27:11.720 --> 27:15.968
This letter is from her fiancé, Jiang Xue Ting.

296
27:15.968 --> 27:17.940
[Jiang Xue Ting]

297
27:22.480 --> 27:26.341
How many German translators did we hire?

298
27:27.800 --> 27:30.724
People who know both German and military equipment are rare.

299
27:30.724 --> 27:32.605
We barely managed to find three.

300
27:33.360 --> 27:36.306
There are tons of weapons manuals to translate.

301
27:36.306 --> 27:37.586
Three people aren't enough.

302
27:38.720 --> 27:40.786
So you mean?

303
27:40.786 --> 27:42.705
Hire Jiang Xue Ting.

304
27:44.120 --> 27:45.120
Yes.

305
27:58.240 --> 27:59.800
[To Jiang Xue Ting] Report tomorrow.

306
28:00.880 --> 28:03.386
All right. I'll report on time tomorrow.

307
28:10.400 --> 28:11.400
Ping Jun.

308
28:12.279 --> 28:13.579
Xue Ting.

309
28:15.080 --> 28:17.079
What are you so happy about?

310
28:17.079 --> 28:19.900
I'll report to the 9th General Staff of the Yu Army.

311
28:19.900 --> 28:21.359
I'll be a translator and secretary.

312
28:26.306 --> 28:28.880
What's wrong? Why the long face?

313
28:30.840 --> 28:33.003
Weren't you going to work at a newspaper?

314
28:33.003 --> 28:35.720
Why the sudden switch to the army?

315
28:36.360 --> 28:39.043
I want some experience in the army and broaden my horizons first.

316
28:39.043 --> 28:40.500
Then I'll work at a newspaper.

317
28:45.400 --> 28:47.099
Do you have something on your mind?

318
28:52.080 --> 28:57.435
A while back, I worked as a copyist at the Xiangxi Hotel's Yuchun Opera House.

319
28:57.435 --> 28:59.840
I got caught up in an assassination case.

320
28:59.840 --> 29:02.890
Yu Chang Xuan mistook me for a suspect.

321
29:02.890 --> 29:06.600
We have some bad blood between us.

322
29:06.600 --> 29:08.120
Did they give you a hard time?

323
29:08.120 --> 29:09.520
Not really.

324
29:09.520 --> 29:12.470
Once they got to the bottom of it, they let me go.

325
29:12.470 --> 29:15.737
What worries me most is that this could affect you.

326
29:17.560 --> 29:18.880
Don't worry.

327
29:18.880 --> 29:20.360
It's only temporary.

328
29:20.360 --> 29:21.800
I'm in a civilian position.

329
29:21.800 --> 29:23.786
I won't have much contact with them.

330
29:24.760 --> 29:28.966
After a while, I'll find another more stable job.

331
29:35.760 --> 29:37.240
All right.

332
29:37.240 --> 29:39.273
But be careful.

333
29:54.440 --> 29:56.020
The Corps Commander is here.

334
30:12.180 --> 30:13.180
Sit.

335
30:14.880 --> 30:18.226
Welcome, talented translators.

336
30:18.800 --> 30:23.750
You all excelled in the written exams and interviews, beating out the competition.

337
30:23.750 --> 30:29.964
As the saying goes, "a man who fails to make his mark wastes his gifts".

338
30:29.964 --> 30:32.924
My philosophy is innovation.

339
30:32.924 --> 30:37.200
I want to equip the Yu Army with the most advanced weapons and equipment.

340
30:37.200 --> 30:43.253
I don't want outdated gear to get my soldiers killed for nothing.

341
30:44.080 --> 30:48.080
The General Staff will send you the latest German weapons data every day.

342
30:48.080 --> 30:52.480
Please translate their performance specs and manufacturing procedures.

343
30:52.480 --> 30:57.680
Of the four of you, only Bao Shi Jie studied at a military academy in Japan.

344
30:57.680 --> 30:59.937
He knows firearms well.

345
30:59.937 --> 31:02.840
So, for now, he'll serve as acting team leader.

346
31:02.840 --> 31:03.953
Yes, sir.

347
31:04.520 --> 31:07.240
I hope you will give me your full support.

348
31:08.440 --> 31:09.840
All right, everyone.

349
31:09.840 --> 31:12.126
I'll take you to the Translation Office to report in.

350
31:12.126 --> 31:13.880
You can start work today.

351
31:19.680 --> 31:21.021
Jiang Xue Ting.

352
31:25.480 --> 31:26.653
Come.

353
31:30.880 --> 31:32.426
You want to see me?

354
31:33.640 --> 31:37.120
You're a graduate of Waseda University with a degree in international politics.

355
31:37.120 --> 31:41.615
You excelled in every subject and wrote beautifully.

356
31:41.615 --> 31:44.559
You had plenty of options.

357
31:45.360 --> 31:46.966
Why join the military?

358
31:47.680 --> 31:50.867
You recruited a foreign-language translator while reforming the military.

359
31:50.867 --> 31:57.113
I imagine you must be a forward-thinking and broad-minded commander.

360
31:57.113 --> 31:59.539
Under your command, I will make a real contribution.

361
31:59.539 --> 32:02.140
This way, I won't let my years of study go to waste.

362
32:03.800 --> 32:05.280
Good.

363
32:05.280 --> 32:07.286
I don't care about seniority or background.

364
32:07.286 --> 32:08.685
Only ability matters.

365
32:09.500 --> 32:11.140
Thank you.

366
32:13.000 --> 32:14.753
How many people are in your family?

367
32:20.120 --> 32:21.916
My parents died when I was young.

368
32:21.916 --> 32:26.920
As for family, I have a fiancée.

369
32:26.920 --> 32:30.039
Her mother and my mother were sworn sisters.

370
32:35.000 --> 32:37.081
Then you must work even harder.

371
32:38.040 --> 32:43.882
Your fiancée and her mother will be counting on you from now on.

372
32:48.120 --> 32:49.759
I won't forget that.

373
33:04.640 --> 33:07.179
The chicken's finally tender.

374
33:12.240 --> 33:15.820
Take this chicken soup to Xue Ting while it's hot.

375
33:17.960 --> 33:21.040
Now? He may have finished eating already.

376
33:21.040 --> 33:24.440
Food in the mess hall can't compare with home cooking.

377
33:24.440 --> 33:25.899
All right.

378
33:26.880 --> 33:28.620
Just take it over.

379
33:30.420 --> 33:31.720
Go.

380
33:32.359 --> 33:33.799
Go on.

381
33:34.560 --> 33:36.980
Come back early for chicken soup after you send this.

382
33:36.980 --> 33:38.220
Got it.

383
33:47.560 --> 33:48.680
Hello.

384
33:48.680 --> 33:51.106
Secretary Jiang, a Miss Ye is here to see you.

385
33:51.826 --> 33:52.826
Got it.

386
34:15.000 --> 34:16.174
Xue Ting.

387
34:16.960 --> 34:19.000
Why did you come out without an umbrella?

388
34:19.000 --> 34:20.079
What brings you here?

389
34:20.079 --> 34:22.873
Mom made chicken soup and sent me to bring it to you.

390
34:40.080 --> 34:42.920
How long have you been waiting? Your hair's soaked.

391
34:52.520 --> 34:54.699
In rain this heavy, you shouldn't have come.

392
34:54.699 --> 34:56.199
What if you catch a cold?

393
34:56.960 --> 34:58.080
I'm fine.

394
34:58.080 --> 35:00.610
When I left home today, it wasn't raining this hard yet.

395
35:00.610 --> 35:02.199
But it got heavier and heavier once I was out.

396
35:02.199 --> 35:03.539
I miscalculated.

397
35:15.600 --> 35:17.199
All right. You should head back.

398
35:17.199 --> 35:18.360
I'll get you a rickshaw.

399
35:18.360 --> 35:19.440
No need.

400
35:19.440 --> 35:20.970
It's hard to find a ride in the rain.

401
35:20.970 --> 35:22.239
Take this home.

402
35:22.239 --> 35:24.000
It won't taste as good once it gets cold.

403
35:24.000 --> 35:25.090
Go on. Don't overdo it.

404
35:25.090 --> 35:26.280
Ye Ping Jun?

405
35:29.640 --> 35:31.220
You two...

406
35:31.840 --> 35:34.220
Well, I'll be going.

407
35:40.120 --> 35:42.440
Shouldn't even greet your superior?

408
35:42.440 --> 35:44.180
You have no manners.

409
35:53.240 --> 35:54.639
I see.

410
35:55.400 --> 35:57.239
Could those two be...

411
36:00.786 --> 36:01.880
Master Chang Xuan.

412
36:01.880 --> 36:04.920
The 15 classmates from your military academy have all reported for duty.

413
36:04.920 --> 36:07.197
Wu Zuo Xiao will temporarily take over Huang Da Kui's position.

414
36:07.197 --> 36:09.635
He'll be the commander of the 27th Regiment.

415
36:09.635 --> 36:11.080
Give them free rein.

416
36:11.080 --> 36:12.280
Tell them not to overthink it.

417
36:12.280 --> 36:13.923
Big news, guys.

418
36:13.923 --> 36:15.553
I've got a major scoop.

419
36:15.553 --> 36:19.241
I'm telling you, you'll definitely want to hear this.

420
36:22.120 --> 36:23.120
Go on.

421
36:23.960 --> 36:26.210
- I-- - Come on, don't be like that.

422
36:26.210 --> 36:30.659
Listen. Do you want to know who Jiang Xue Ting's girlfriend is?

423
36:34.280 --> 36:38.120
Think about him! You could rack your brains and still never guess this.

424
36:38.920 --> 36:44.200
His girlfriend is actually Ye Ping Jun.

425
36:44.960 --> 36:47.800
I know it's hard to believe.

426
36:47.800 --> 36:49.777
I couldn't believe it either.

427
36:49.777 --> 36:51.659
But I just went downstairs and saw it with my own eyes.

428
36:51.659 --> 36:53.920
Man. It was pouring out there.

429
36:53.920 --> 36:55.960
And Ye Ping Jun personally brought him soup.

430
36:55.960 --> 36:58.640
That can't be a coincidence, right?

431
36:59.525 --> 37:02.200
Well, show them around and walk them through the workflow.

432
37:02.200 --> 37:03.800
They're all new here, after all.

433
37:03.800 --> 37:05.560
Don't worry. I'll handle it.

434
37:05.560 --> 37:07.565
What are you talking about?

435
37:07.565 --> 37:09.506
This doesn't surprise you at all?

436
37:16.840 --> 37:18.680
I get it now.

437
37:18.680 --> 37:21.600
Now I see why you insisted on bringing Jiang Xue Ting in.

438
37:21.600 --> 37:23.697
So you knew all along that he was Ye Ping Jun's boyfriend.

439
37:23.697 --> 37:25.900
That's why you kept him close, right?

440
37:31.640 --> 37:34.292
In my office, we don't discuss that nonsense.

441
37:34.292 --> 37:36.580
Only military business is discussed here.

442
37:38.960 --> 37:43.580
If you don't give me a straight answer, I'll take that as a yes.

443
37:45.880 --> 37:50.840
If you have that much free time, I'll send you to oversee a suburban quarry.

444
37:50.840 --> 37:51.920
No. Please don't.

445
37:51.920 --> 37:54.617
You always go straight for the eyes.

446
37:54.617 --> 37:56.200
That takes all the fun out of it.

447
37:56.200 --> 37:57.533
I'll leave you to it.

448
38:03.200 --> 38:04.780
Show them the ropes.

449
38:04.780 --> 38:05.780
Yes, sir.

450
38:14.440 --> 38:15.923
I knew it.

451
38:15.923 --> 38:18.940
When she was sick, he secretly went to visit her.

452
38:19.836 --> 38:25.390
Then, he had you use Lan Qing's name to get her away from Tao Xi Li.

453
38:25.390 --> 38:29.906
And now, he has put her actual boyfriend right in the army.

454
38:31.565 --> 38:36.173
When has he ever gone to this much trouble for a woman?

455
38:42.420 --> 38:44.360
You!

456
38:44.360 --> 38:45.560
I--

457
38:45.560 --> 38:47.726
Are you made of wood or something?

458
38:48.336 --> 38:50.000
We're talking about love here.

459
38:50.000 --> 38:51.890
Do you even understand love?

460
38:51.890 --> 38:56.659
The kind of love that makes the sun, moon, and stars fade away.

461
38:59.000 --> 39:01.160
Could you at least play along a little?

462
39:01.160 --> 39:03.500
Give me some kind of reaction.

463
39:06.920 --> 39:08.913
That's not part of my duties.

464
39:13.340 --> 39:15.059
You silly boy.

465
39:15.059 --> 39:17.960
Duty isn't everything in life.

466
39:17.960 --> 39:20.960
Once you've had a taste of love, you'll understand.

467
39:20.960 --> 39:25.600
Even a man as hard as steel can be completely transformed.

468
39:28.840 --> 39:30.160
Where are you going?

469
39:30.160 --> 39:31.940
Playing hard to get, are you?

470
39:31.940 --> 39:35.460
I'm telling you, believe it or not, Master Chang Xuan is truly in love this time.

471
40:33.920 --> 40:35.959
Can you help me?

472
40:36.600 --> 40:38.281
My hair is stuck.

473
42:58.360 --> 42:59.659
Seven.

474
43:00.780 --> 43:02.139
Eight.

475
43:02.139 --> 43:03.280
Nine.

476
43:07.920 --> 43:08.920
Ten.

477
43:14.880 --> 43:16.160
Master Chang Xuan.

478
43:17.015 --> 43:18.840
I have a proposal.

479
43:18.840 --> 43:20.000
A proposal?

480
43:20.000 --> 43:21.350
Yes.

481
43:21.350 --> 43:23.000
Do you dare make a bet with me?

482
43:26.960 --> 43:28.493
You bastard.

483
43:42.000 --> 43:43.539
I'll ask you one more time.

484
43:44.640 --> 43:46.193
Who am I to you?
